% expect-output: 5
% expect-output: 10
% Scenario: exit inside a procedure nested in a for loop leaves the loop.
% Expect: prints "5" then "10" (the loop variable at exit and the sum so far).
0 1 1 10 { dup 5 eq { exit } if add } for
= =
